Subject: [PATCH] Restore donation completion acknowledgement

Display the earned badge after immediate donations and restore the eligible first-Boost monthly sustainer link without exposing profile-badge controls. Use existing thank-you copy that does not promise unsupported profile display.

For long-running donations, stop showing the loading indicator after the badge loads when Molly disables the profile-badge toggle. Keep loading visible while the badge is unavailable, and cover both states with focused Compose UI tests.

